  <!-- NOT A NATIVE PIECE. The client's own Camp tab has no Travel button, because on live you
       travel by CLICKING A FELLOWSHIP INSIGNIA in your inventory, an item this server deliberately
       does not have (see aotv4_fellowship.lua: the roguelite death wipe destroys anything outside
       death_loss.M.is_kept, which is what permanently cost the tradeskill tools). With no insignia
       and no button, the only way to reach a campfire was to TYPE "/say fshipgo", which nothing
       tells the player about. -->
